From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Make video processing elastic (RNF-02)

Previews get their own queue and worker. A new video_autoscaler adds
video_tool replicas while jobs wait and removes them when the queue is
idle. The worker runs jobs in a thread with heartbeats on and leaves
cleanly on SIGTERM so unfinished jobs are requeued. Adds tests.

